From 4608020edf3dbe00ec6ca83483b6a9513a189a2a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Lenzeder, Joerg" <joerg.lenzeder@intel.com>
Date: Thu, 6 May 2021 17:14:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] PONRTSYS-8943: Add changes from LGM PON QoS driver back to
 PRX

Adaptations to have same source for kernel versions 4.9 and 4.19
